    "name": "Deadvale",
    "steam_appid": 3504850,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadvale is a fantasy RPG where you have no inventory and may use only what you can carry in your two hands. You are shipwrecked off the coast of a strange, unknown land, a mysterious place that is now your prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for weapons and equipment, survive hand-to-hand combat with dangerous enemies, explore an interactive, physics-based environment, and discover powerful foes in your journey across the forsaken land in which you find yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-to-hand, reaction based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive, physics-based environment</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadvale is a fantasy RPG where you have no inventory and may use only what you can carry in your two hands. You are shipwrecked off the coast of a strange, unknown land, a mysterious place that is now your prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for weapons and equipment, survive hand-to-hand combat with dangerous enemies, explore an interactive, physics-based environment, and discover powerful foes in your journey across the forsaken land in which you find yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-to-hand, reaction based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive, physics-based environment</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You are shipwrecked off the coast of a forsaken land, where dark things lurk - and where evil dwells. Here you will discover powerful weapons, face cunning foes, and brave the terror that awaits you.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
